        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Lugano Airport, Bioggio, Lugano\n- Companies: Darwin Airline, Darwin Airline Group, Baboo, Adria Airways Switzerland\n- Topics: passenger traffic, headquarters, acquisition, branding\n\nFacts:\n- Lugano Airport handles around 200,000 passengers each year and about 2,400 flights.\n- The headquarters of Darwin Airline are located at Lugano Airport.\n- In November 2010, Darwin Airline Group from Lugano acquired Baboo and saved the company from bankruptcy.\n- Darwin Airline SA is a Swiss regional airline with its head office in Bioggio, Lugano, and it flies under the brand name Adria Airways Switzerland.",
